

@startuml

|Librarian|
start
:Receive returned copy;
:Identify the copy;

|System|
:Check if the copy is currently on loan;

if (Copy currently on loan?) then (yes)

    :Retrieve the corresponding loan;
    :Close the loan;
    :Record the return;

    if (Returned late?) then (yes)
        :Extension point: late return;
        :Suspend the member;
    else (no)
    endif

    if (Copy reserved for another member?) then (yes)
        :Keep the copy aside;
        :Notify the member who reserved it;
    else (no)
        :Make the copy available;
    endif

    |Librarian|
    :Print the receipt;

else (no)
    :Display error message;
    stop
endif

stop

@enduml


